# ============================================================
# Locality classifier snapshots (Phase 325)
# ============================================================
# The regenerated KATOTTH snapshot is a 5.6 MB intermediate of
# scripts/locality/build_settlement_import.py. NOTHING reads it at build or at
# runtime -- V171 reads only src/main/resources/db/data/settlements.csv, which
# this snapshot is one input to. Committing it would put a multi-megabyte blob
# in every clone for zero consumers. Regenerate it on demand:
#   python3 scripts/locality/build_settlement_import.py
docs/backend-phases/data/katottg-2025-07-02-free.json
